  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a sanctuary of faith with this beautifully designed Christian bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring inspiring Bible verses and Christian accents, this comforter set makes a thoughtful and meaningful gift for the special women in your life, perfect for birthdays, special occasions, or as a daily reminder of love and faith.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A beautifully designed Christian bedding set, perfect for women, moms, daughters, and sisters, celebrating faith and love.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight Duvet Cover (no filling insert) for customization or a convenient Comforter for all-in-one warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package contains 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional Pillowcases, depending on your selection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Comforter includes whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting, ensuring consistent warmth and comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier, with mesh laundry bag use recommended.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christian Knight Templar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
